              },
              {
                "kind": "motivation",
                "summary": "Previously, the fallback branch assumed message bytes were present and valid UTF-8, leading to unhandled AttributeError, KeyError, or UnicodeDecodeError that triggered a 1011 internal error instead of closing with 1003 unsupported data.",
